nodes.goal:
Install the watch probe. 1) mkdir -p $HERMES_HOME/machine-watch-example. 2) Delete any stale state: rm -f $HERMES_HOME/machine-watch-example/check_cmd.txt $HERMES_HOME/machine-watch-example/last_probe.json (a leftover check from a previous watch must never poll for the wrong condition). 3) Write this exact command, verbatim, as a single line to $HERMES_HOME/machine-watch-example/check_cmd.txt:
{run.check_cmd}
4) Read the file back and compare it byte-for-byte to what you were given. Reply with ONLY fenced json {"watch_name": "{run.watch_name}", "check_cmd": "<the verbatim line>", "state_written": true} — state_written only if the read-back matched.
